## 6. Feedback surfaces (brief obligations)

- **Dependency/provenance view**: DAG of datasets → cells → outputs with per-edge identity hashes and per-node status color/text (not color-only: icon + text + tooltip for accessibility); click any output → its run event.
- **Error/status feedback**: engine conversion errors are already unusually detailed (line number, original line, auto-detected parameters, suggested fixes [FACT S8]); we surface that verbatim plus our own context (which dataset hash, which cell, which contract declaration was violated).
- **Saved vs current diff**: bounded, explicit-truncation row diff between saved output content and the replayed output, plus provenance-diff (which hash changed first in the DAG — "the first cause").

